# NPM Configuration Template
# Copy this to .npmrc and replace ${NPM_TOKEN} with your actual GitHub Personal Access Token
# 
# To use GitHub Packages:
# 1. Create a GitHub Personal Access Token (Settings > Developer settings > Personal access tokens)
# 2. Copy this file to .npmrc
# 3. Replace ${NPM_TOKEN} with your token (or use environment variable NPM_TOKEN)
# 4. Never commit the .npmrc file with your token - it's in .gitignore

@blummify:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
//npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=${NPM_TOKEN}
